    <unit id="BasicDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Simplest Usage. Badge will be hidden when count is 0, but we can use showZero to show it.</source>
        <target state="translated">最簡單的用法。count 為 0 時 Badge 會隱藏，但可以使用 showZero 顯示。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
