    <unit id="PageDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Badge draws attention to notifications, counts, status dots, and ribbon labels without interrupting the user's workflow.</source>
        <target state="translated">Badge 用於提示通知、計數、狀態點和緞帶標籤，在不打斷使用者流程的情況下強調需要關注的資訊。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="PageSubtitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Highlight counts, statuses, and contextual labels near related content.</source>
        <target state="translated">在相關內容旁突出數量、狀態和上下文標籤。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="RedBadgeDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>This will simply display a red badge, without a specific count. If count equals 0, it won't display the dot.</source>
        <target state="translated">簡單展示一個紅色徽標，不顯示具體數字。如果 count 等於 0，則不會顯示圓點。</target>
      </segment>
